<title>USA: Uruguay seeks one mln bbls of crude for November.</title>
<headline>Uruguay seeks one mln bbls of crude for November.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruaguay's state oil refiner ANCAP is seeking one million barrels of crude oil for November delivery, traders said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The purchase tender asks for the cargo to be delivered November 5-10. Offers are to be submitted today.</p>
<p>Uruguay recently bought spot West African crudes, and has also accepted Argentine grades.</p>
<p>--Jacqueline Wong, New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620</p>
</text>
